  "description": "WIBBAM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C12 H8 As1 Dy2 O52 W10 11-,11(C1 H6 N3 1+),9(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, W1 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W2 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W3 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W4 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W5 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W6 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W7 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W8 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W9 (W) has 6 O neighbors; W10 (W) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.413-4.023 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.63-160.43°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [C(NH2)3]11[Dy2(Hcit)2(AsW10O38)]·9H2O.",
